            "accordion": {
              "type": "accordion",
              "settings": {},
              "blocks": {
                "accordion-row-1": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Delivery & what arrives",
                    "open_by_default": true
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Free delivery to any UK mainland address, with no minimum spend. Express Dispatch beds leave us in 1–3 working days; everything else within 4. We email tracking as soon as it ships, and the courier contacts you in advance with your delivery day.</p><p>Delivery is by specialist large-item courier <strong>to your front door</strong>. Someone over 18 needs to be in to receive it. Everything arrives flat-packed in protective packaging, with clear assembly instructions and all fittings included.</p><p>Northern Ireland, the Scottish Highlands and UK islands: email us before ordering and we'll confirm your postcode and any additional cost.</p>"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion-row-2": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Size guide",
                    "open_by_default": false
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>UK bed sizes, mattress dimensions:</p><ul><li>Small single — 2ft6 · 75 × 190cm</li><li>Single — 3ft · 90 × 190cm</li><li>Small double — 4ft · 120 × 190cm</li><li>Double — 4ft6 · 135 × 190cm</li><li>King — 5ft · 150 × 200cm</li><li>Super king — 6ft · 180 × 200cm</li></ul><p>The frame sits a little larger than the mattress. Leave around 60cm of walking space each side where the room allows, and 90cm in front of wardrobe doors. Measure the doorway and any turn on the stairs before ordering.</p>"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion-row-3": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Returns & damage",
                    "open_by_default": false
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>You have 30 days from delivery to tell us it isn't right. It needs to be unused, in original condition and original packaging. We'll quote the collection cost before you confirm anything and deduct it from your refund. Refunds are issued within 14 days of it reaching us.</p><p>For hygiene reasons a mattress can only be returned as a change of mind while still sealed in its packaging. Once unsealed it can only be returned if faulty.</p><p>Damaged in transit? Email azixparz@outlook.com within 48 hours with photos and your order number — collection for faulty goods is arranged and paid for by us. Your rights under the Consumer Rights Act 2015 are unaffected.</p>"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text"
                  ]
                }
